<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/8/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Employees Provident Fund Act 1991 [Act 452], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in the heading of Part VIIa by substituting for the words “MEMBER OF THE FUND” the word “EMPLOYEE”. Substitution of section 70a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/8/eng@> .
