<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/8/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 70a the following section: “Application 70a. This Part shall apply to an employee who is not a Malaysian citizen: (a) whose country of domicile is outside Malaysia; and (b) who enters and remains temporarily under the authority of any pass issued under the provisions of any written law relating to immigration.”. Amendment of section 70c"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/8/eng@> .
